Logistics & Transportation Analytics — Capstone Project

Project Title: Logistics Operations, Delivery, Driver, Fleet, Cost, Maintenance & Safety Analysis
Tool Used: Microsoft Power BI
Project Type: Data Analytics Capstone Project

1. Project Overview

This capstone project involved developing four interactive Power BI dashboards to analyze logistics and transportation operations. The goal was to transform raw operational data into meaningful insights that can help management monitor delivery performance, evaluate driver productivity, optimize fleet utilization, control operational costs, and improve safety.

The dashboards provide a consolidated view of key business performance indicators (KPIs), enabling stakeholders to identify trends, monitor performance, and make data-driven decisions.

1. Project Objectives

* Analyze delivery and operational performance.
* Monitor on-time delivery rates and delivery trends.
* Evaluate driver productivity and performance.
* Measure fleet utilization and vehicle maintenance.
* Track fuel expenditure and maintenance costs.
* Analyze safety incidents and identify areas for operational improvement.

1. Data Preparation and Analysis

The project involved working with multiple datasets related to logistics operations, drivers, trips, vehicles, deliveries, fuel purchases, maintenance, and safety incidents.

Key activities included:

* Data Cleaning: Identified and handled missing values, checked data consistency, and prepared datasets for analysis.
* Power Query: Used Power Query to clean, transform, and prepare data for reporting.
* Data Modeling: Established relationships between relevant datasets to support cross-functional analysis.
* DAX Measures: Created measures to calculate important performance indicators and summarize business performance.
* Data Visualization: Designed interactive dashboards using KPI cards, bar charts, line charts, and doughnut/gauge visuals.
* Dashboard Design: Applied a consistent green-and-white theme with navigation panels to make the dashboards organized and easy to explore.

1. Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

Dashboard 1: Operations & Delivery Performance

The dashboard monitors delivery efficiency, revenue, customer activity, and overall logistics operations.

