Key Insights

* The business recorded approximately $2.63 million in total revenue.
* The dashboard reports approximately 85,000 loads and 85,000 trips, highlighting the scale of logistics activity.
* The on-time delivery rate of 44.6% indicates a potential area for improvement in delivery reliability.
* Revenue per mile provides a useful measure for monitoring transportation revenue efficiency.
* Monthly delivery and revenue visuals help management identify changes in performance over time.

Recommendations

* Investigate the causes of delayed deliveries.
* Monitor route performance and delivery timelines.
* Review monthly revenue and load trends to identify opportunities for improved efficiency.

